  {γ | Formalism.UG.cT (starRingEnd I.E) γ * I.J * γ = I.J ∧
    (∀ p ≤ 2 * a, ∀ y ∈ G (p + 1), (γ - 1) *ᵥ y ∈ G p) ∧ ∀ w, ‖op I x w (γ - 1)‖ ≤ de}

